---
import EventGroupPage from '../components/EventGroupPage.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<EventGroupPage sectionKey="wonders" title="Wonder Events" active="wonder-events" pageMark="🏛️">
  The choices that can appear when you complete a <a href={`${base}wonders`}>Wonder</a>, such as dedicating
  the Ziggurat's terrace shrine or picking which family the Acropolis honors. Some only have a chance to
  appear. They come on top of the completion announcement, which always fires and grants 2, 4, 6 or 8
  Legitimacy by wonder tier.
</EventGroupPage>
